<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 3/4.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 3/4.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>3/4 at 1000GMT. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to</p>
<p>a German mark.</p>
<p>	   April 3/4	April 2/3</p>
<p> CZK	0.46414	 0.46467</p>
<p> DKK	2.0979	  2.09958</p>
<p> FIM	2.66624	 2.68473</p>
<p> HUF	0.07592	0.07604</p>
<p> JPY	0.10892	 0.10929</p>
<p> LTL	3.3441	  3.34532</p>
<p> LVL     23.12856	23.1181</p>
<p> RUR	0.00233	 0.00233</p>
<p> SEK	1.74976	 1.76221</p>
<p> UAH	7.16273	 7.16636</p>
<p> USD     13.3764	 13.3796</p>
<p> XEU     15.55875	15.58121</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
